                            <TextRuns>
                              <TextRun>
                                <Value>CARRIER'S AGENTS ENDORSEMENTS: (Include Agent(s) at POD)
SHIPPER'S LOAD, COUNT AND SEALED
</Value>
                                <Style>
                                  <FontFamily>Arial Rounded MT Bold</FontFamily>
                                  <FontSize>5pt</FontSize>
                                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                                </Style>
                              </TextRun>
                              <TextRun>
                                <Value>INCOTERM mentioned strictly without prejudice to the Terms of the contract of Carriage
"Said to contain, the carrier had no means to verify shipper's representation and the latter to be ultimately responsible for short-ages established at destination in case the container is discharged with the same seal as noted on this bill of lading".
SHIPPER DECLARES THAT ANY APPLICABLE WOOD PACKAGING MATERIALS COMPLY WITH ISPM15 REGULATIONS. FAILURE TO COMPLY WILL RESULT IN CONTAINERS BEING RETURNED TO LOAD PORT OR CARGO DESTROYED - ALL COSTS/FINES/PENALTIES WILL BE FOR SHIPPERS ACCOUNT</Value>
                                <Style>
                                  <FontFamily>Arial Rounded MT Bold</FontFamily>
                                  <FontSize>4pt</FontSize>
                                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
